OL,3,AIsraeli military launches rare ground
OL,4,Aoperation in Gaza beyond Yellow Line
OL,5,
OL,6,FIsraeli ground forces have launched a
OL,7,Frare operation in part of the central
OL,8,FGaza Strip outside their control, after
OL,9,Fissuing evacuation orders for
OL,10,Fresidents.
OL,12,FWitnesses said tanks advanced east of
OL,13,FNuseirat refugee camp and rolled onto
OL,14,Fthe territory's main north to south
OL,15,Froad under the cover of artillery
OL,16,Fstrikes.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
